      "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:23:15.771Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have set a field as hidden (hidden = 1) in the DocType and pushed the changes to Git. The field is also marked as hidden in the database. However, it is still visible in the UI. What could be causing this, and how can I resolve it?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/e/4e4bf9de8c77a909ff6264a8f32a0ccd7ff6262a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4e4bf9de8c77a909ff6264a8f32a0ccd7ff6262a\" title=\"Screenshot from 2025-11-21 11-47-03\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/e/4e4bf9de8c77a909ff6264a8f32a0ccd7ff6262a.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-11-21 11-47-03\" data-base62-sha1=\"baE1hk6ybNTWxBOGh4vMRurgjKa\" width=\"690\" height=\"328\" data-dominant-color=\"351029\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2025-11-21 11-47-03</span><span class=\"informations\">725×345 26 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/5/658f9d7ec197e8a308b3f351393cb69b0d9d652d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/658f9d7ec197e8a308b3f351393cb69b0d9d652d\" title=\"Screenshot from 2025-11-21 11-45-40\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/5/658f9d7ec197e8a308b3f351393cb69b0d9d652d_2_690x416.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-11-21 11-45-40\" data-base62-sha1=\"eurUXsO0lODl0IDbBcMeUDvgkSV\" width=\"690\" height=\"416\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/5/658f9d7ec197e8a308b3f351393cb69b0d9d652d_2_690x416.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/5/658f9d7e