      "name": "Yamen Zakhour",
      "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:29:26.088Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This looks like ERPNext -‘s Sales Invoice doctype and not related to your custom app. I think the correct way is to use “Customize Form” then from the same customize form click on Export customizations to App. This will export customizations as fixtures in your app.</p>",
